620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the realm of cutting-edge eye care solutions, Alcon stands as a beacon of innovation and excellence, dedicated to enhancing vision health worldwide. With over 75 years of pioneering heritage, Alcon has solidified its position as the largest eye care device company globally, serving patients in over 140 countries. Their commitment to helping people see brilliantly is unwavering, driving every aspect of their operations, from research and development to manufacturing and distribution.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On another frontier of innovation, the MarTech team, within its dynamic and innovative domain, is poised to revolutionize webpage management. As an intern within this visionary group, the journey extends far beyond conventional website construction. It encompasses a holistic approach, integrating state-of-the-art technologies, rigorous quality assurance processes, and strategic marketing initiatives to deliver unparalleled digital experiences for clients and end-users worldwide.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 498 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
endobj
624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (CHAPTER 2  DESCRIPTION OF ORGANIZATION )
/E (CHAPTER 2  DESCRIPTION OF ORGANIZATION )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Alcon is the global leader in eye care, dedicated to helping people see brilliantly. With an over 75- year heritage, they are the largest eye care device company in the world, with complementary businesses in Surgical and Vision Care. Being a truly global company, they work in over 50 countries and serve patients in more than 140 countries. Alcon is grounded in cutting-edge innovation and breakthrough technology, transforming the way eye diseases and eye conditions are treated. They have the widest array of eye care offerings in the industry with products organized into two business: Surgical and Vision Care. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Alcon's vision is to pioneer advancements in eye care globally, setting new standards of excellence and innovation. They aspire to lead the industry by delivering transformative solutions that improve vision health and enhance the lives of individuals worldwide. With a commitment to pushing the boundaries of what's possible, Alcon aims to be at the forefront of research, development, and delivery of cutting-edge eye care products and services.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Their vision encompasses a dedication to addressing unmet needs, expanding access to quality eye care, and ultimately, empowering people to experience the world with clarity and confidence. By striving for excellence in every endeavor, Alcon aims to redefine the future of vision health and make a meaningful difference in the lives of patients and communities around the globe.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The mission of Alcon is to improve vision health worldwide by relentlessly pursuing the goal of helping people see brilliantly. This mission is reflected in every aspect of their operations, from research and development to manufacturing and distribution. Their commitment to quality, safety, and corporate responsibility underscores their mission to make a positive impact on eye health globally. Through their extensive portfolio of products and solutions, Alcon aims to address the diverse needs and challenges faced by patients and healthcare professionals alike, ensuring that everyone has the opportunity to enjoy clear vision and optimal eye health.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 499 0 R
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (CHAPTER 3 SCOPE OF WORK )
/E (CHAPTER 3 SCOPE OF WORK )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
631 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As adept Drupal developers, our mastery of PHP for server-side validation, coupled with our fluency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, forms the cornerstone of our skill set. These languages collectively empower us to craft dynamic and secure websites tailored precisely to our clients' needs.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
632 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Harnessing the formidable capabilities of Drupal, we leverage its flexibility and scalability to seamlessly integrate bespoke functionalities and third-party extensions, ensuring each website fulfills its unique project requirements. Our project management endeavors are fortified by Jira, furnishing us with a robust framework for organizing tasks, tracking progress, and fostering efficient collaboration among team members.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
633 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With its intuitive interface and comprehensive feature suite, Jira facilitates seamless communication and coordination, thereby facilitating the timely and budget-conscious delivery of projects. Meanwhile, Acquia Cloud stands as our trusted repository for data storage and retrieval, furnishing a secure and reliable infrastructure for hosting our Drupal websites. Its scalability and performance optimization features ensure our websites remain responsive and accessible even amidst substantial traffic influxes.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
634 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To uphold stringent quality standards, we employ Percy for rigorous quality assurance testing, automating visual testing across diverse devices and browsers. By proactively identifying visual regressions during the development phase, Percy aids us in upholding the pinnacle of quality and ensuring our websites consistently deliver exceptional user experiences.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
635 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In summary, our proficiency in PHP and frontend technologies, combined with the seamless integration of Drupal and complementary tools such as Jira, Acquia Cloud, and Percy, empowers us to deliver robust and innovative web solutions with remarkable efficiency. Through strategic tool utilization and an unwavering commitment to excellence, we continually produce digital experiences that transcend our clients' expectations.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
636 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 500 0 R
/Pg 17 0 R
>>
endobj
637 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Tools and Technologies used by the MarTech team are:)
/E (Tools and Technologies used by the MarTech team are:)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
638 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (1. DRUPAL Alcon employs Drupal as its primary web platform to manage its online presence effectively. With Drupal's versatile content management capabilities, Alcon can create and maintain various components of its digital ecosystem, including its corporate website, product catalog, and educational resources. Drupal's scalability enables Alcon to adapt and expand its online offerings as needed, whether it's integrating e-commerce functionality to facilitate online sales or implementing community engagement features to foster interaction among users. By leveraging Drupal's user-friendly interface and robust features, Alcon can ensure a seamless and engaging experience for visitors, promoting brand awareness, enhancing customer satisfaction, and driving business growth in the competitive landscape of eye care.)
