/T (4. CLOUDFLARE In the web team, Cloudflare is a vital tool used to enhance website security, performance, and reliability. By leveraging Cloudflare's robust network, the team can mitigate various cyber threats and attacks, ensuring the safety of their websites, APIs, and corporate networks. Cloudflare's advanced security features, such as DDoS protection and Web Application Firewall \(WAF\), help defend against malicious activities and unauthorized access attempts, safeguarding sensitive data and user privacy. Additionally, Cloudflare accelerates website traffic through its content delivery network \(CDN\), optimizing page load times and improving overall user experience. The team also utilizes Cloudflare for managing DNS records efficiently, ensuring seamless domain management and propagation. Moreover, Cloudflare's serverless computing capabilities enable the deployment of serverless code, allowing the team to execute functions without the need for traditional server infrastructure. Overall, Cloudflare empowers the web team to deliver safer, faster, and more reliable web experiences to their audience.)
/E (4. CLOUDFLARE In the web team, Cloudflare is a vital tool used to enhance website security, performance, and reliability. By leveraging Cloudflare's robust network, the team can mitigate various cyber threats and attacks, ensuring the safety of their websites, APIs, and corporate networks. Cloudflare's advanced security features, such as DDoS protection and Web Application Firewall \(WAF\), help defend against malicious activities and unauthorized access attempts, safeguarding sensitive data and user privacy. Additionally, Cloudflare accelerates website traffic through its content delivery network \(CDN\), optimizing page load times and improving overall user experience. The team also utilizes Cloudflare for managing DNS records efficiently, ensuring seamless domain management and propagation. Moreover, Cloudflare's serverless computing capabilities enable the deployment of serverless code, allowing the team to execute functions without the need for traditional server infrastructure. Overall, Cloudflare empowers the web team to deliver safer, faster, and more reliable web experiences to their audience.)
