/T (5. ACQUIA CLOUD SITE FACTORY In the web team, Acquia Cloud Site Factory \(ACSF\) serves as a centralized platform for efficiently managing and scaling a portfolio of websites. The team leverages ACSF to streamline the process of building, managing, and updating multiple websites from a single interface. With ACSF, they can easily deploy new sites and templates, assign roles and permissions, and enforce policies and governance across all sites in the portfolio. ACSF's staging capabilities enable the team to test changes and updates in a controlled environment before deploying them to production, ensuring seamless website management and minimizing the risk of errors or disruptions. Additionally, ACSF provides access to Acquia's team of Drupal experts, offering valuable support and guidance to the web team in optimizing their Drupal-based websites and resolving technical issues efficiently. Overall, ACSF enables the web team to achieve greater efficiency, consistency, and cost-effectiveness in managing their portfolio of websites.)
