/T (7. BITSIGHT In the web team, BitSight serves as a crucial tool for assessing and managing cyber risk associated with the organization's digital assets, including websites and online platforms. The team utilizes BitSight's security ratings to gain insights into the security posture of their web infrastructure and areas of improvement. By regularly monitoring BitSight's cyber risk ratings, the web team can proactively address security issues and mitigate risks before they escalate into major threats. This includes implementing security patches, updates, and best practices to strengthen the resilience of their web assets against cyberattacks. Additionally, BitSight provides the web team with real-time information and business insights, enabling them to make informed decisions about prioritizing security measures and allocating resources effectively. By leveraging BitSight's comprehensive analytics and reporting capabilities, the web team can track their security performance over time and demonstrate compliance with industry standards and regulations. Overall, BitSight empowers the web team to enhance the security and resilience of their digital infrastructure, safeguarding against cyber threats and ensuring the integrity and availability of their web assets.)
