/T (5. Update Content Management Strategy: Reviewing and updating the content management strategy involves ensuring regular updates, accuracy, relevance, and optimization for search engines, which can be time-consuming. Implement content management systems \(CMS\) with robust editorial workflows, content scheduling capabilities, and SEO optimization tools. Provide training and resources to content creators to maintain consistency and quality. )
/E (5. Update Content Management Strategy: Reviewing and updating the content management strategy involves ensuring regular updates, accuracy, relevance, and optimization for search engines, which can be time-consuming. Implement content management systems \(CMS\) with robust editorial workflows, content scheduling capabilities, and SEO optimization tools. Provide training and resources to content creators to maintain consistency and quality. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
>>
