<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (6. Develop Product Showcase: Creating dedicated product pages with detailed descriptions, specifications, and images requires coordination with product teams and integrating interactive features for user engagement. Collaborate closely with product managers to gather comprehensive product information and assets. Implement interactive features such as product comparison tools and virtual try-on experiences to enhance user engagement and decision-making. )
/E (6. Develop Product Showcase: Creating dedicated product pages with detailed descriptions, specifications, and images requires coordination with product teams and integrating interactive features for user engagement. Collaborate closely with product managers to gather comprehensive product information and assets. Implement interactive features such as product comparison tools and virtual try-on experiences to enhance user engagement and decision-making. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
