657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (7. Optimize User Experience: Conducting usability testing and optimizing user experience requires identifying pain points and opportunities for improvement, which may vary among different user segments.  Conduct usability testing with representative user groups to identify usability issues and gather qualitative feedback. Use heatmaps and user journey analysis to optimize navigation, page layout, and conversion paths for a seamless browsing experience. )
/E (7. Optimize User Experience: Conducting usability testing and optimizing user experience requires identifying pain points and opportunities for improvement, which may vary among different user segments.  Conduct usability testing with representative user groups to identify usability issues and gather qualitative feedback. Use heatmaps and user journey analysis to optimize navigation, page layout, and conversion paths for a seamless browsing experience. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
