/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (8. Enhance Accessibility Compliance: Implementing accessibility features such as keyboard navigation and optimized color contrast requires adherence to industry standards and legal requirements, which can be complex. Follow Web Content Accessibility Guidelines \(WCAG\) and consult accessibility experts to ensure compliance. Use automated accessibility testing tools to identify and remediate accessibility issues efficiently. )
/E (8. Enhance Accessibility Compliance: Implementing accessibility features such as keyboard navigation and optimized color contrast requires adherence to industry standards and legal requirements, which can be complex. Follow Web Content Accessibility Guidelines \(WCAG\) and consult accessibility experts to ensure compliance. Use automated accessibility testing tools to identify and remediate accessibility issues efficiently. )
/Pg 21 0 R
