/ActualText (During my internship tenure, I have made significant achievements in redesigning and managing the Alcon website. By focusing on content management, product showcase, user experience optimization, and accessibility compliance, I have enhanced the overall experience for users. The modernized layout, improved navigation, and visually appealing design have made it easier for users to find relevant information quickly and intuitively. Regular updates to the content ensure that users have access to the latest information about Alcon's products and services, thereby increasing engagement and satisfaction. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
