669 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During my internship at Alcon Eye Care, I collaborated with a dynamic team led by Solution Delivery Manager Prashant Agarwal to develop and maintain the company's websites. Through dedication, creativity, and effective communication, we navigated challenges and delivered quality results. I contributed to tasks such as website maintenance, content management, and visual testing using tools like Percy. Immersed in Marketing technologies \(MARTECH\), I gained hands-on experience with content management systems, Customer Data Platforms \(CDP\), and analytics tools, enabling data-driven decision-making. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
670 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I not only gained technical skills but also learned valuable lessons about ethical behavior in the corporate world. Under the leadership of Solution Delivery Manager Prashant Agarwal, I witnessed firsthand the importance of integrity, transparency, and accountability in all aspects of business operations. Through open communication and mutual respect, I learned to navigate complex situations with honesty and integrity, always prioritizing ethical considerations in decision-making.  As I transition into my future career, I carry with me the invaluable lesson that success is not only measured by outcomes but also by the ethical principles that guide our actions. The final outcome of the internship project focused on redesigning and managing the Alcon website with a comprehensive approach to content management, product showcase, user experience optimization, and accessibility compliance. By prioritizing the needs and preferences of users, the project resulted in an improved website that offers enhanced usability, relevant content, detailed product information, and an engaging user experience. The implementation of accessibility features ensures inclusivity and equal access to information for all users, including those with disabilities. Overall, the internship project successfully delivers a valuable and satisfying online experience for the final users of the Alcon website, contributing to the company's mission of improving vision health worldwide.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
