>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Encourage interns to collaborate across various departments and teams within the organization. Leaders and mentors should facilitate introductions and connections, providing interns with insights into different aspects of the business and expanding their professional network. Foster a culture of peer learning and knowledge sharing through regular meetups, brainstorming sessions, or knowledge-sharing events. Interns should be encouraged to share their experiences, insights, and skills with each other, creating a supportive community of learners.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
676 0 obj
<<
