/ActualText (In conclusion, my internship at Alcon Eye Care was a transformative experience where I developed technical skills, learned the importance of ethical behavior in the corporate world, and honed teamwork and problem-solving abilities. Under the leadership of Solution Delivery Manager Prashant Agarwal, I contributed to website development, content management, and visual testing, gaining valuable hands-on experience in Marketing technologies \(MARTECH\). The internship not only equipped me with practical skills but also instilled in me a commitment to integrity, transparency, and accountability in all aspects of business. )
