/K [1]
>>
endobj
682 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As I move forward in my career, I carry with me the lessons learned and the invaluable experiences gained during this internship. This internship served as a platform for personal and professional growth, allowing me to expand my horizons and develop a deeper understanding of the intersection between technology, business, and ethics. Through collaborative projects and mentorship from seasoned professionals like Prashant Agarwal, I learned to navigate complex challenges with resilience and determination. Additionally, the exposure to Marketing technologies provided me with insights into the evolving landscape of digital marketing and the importance of data-driven decision-making. The emphasis on ethical behavior and integrity has left a lasting impression on me, shaping not only my professional conduct but also my personal values. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
